# Prophetic Prism: "{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color." (CR 605.1a, 106.1b): a mana ability that is paid with {1} from the pool and
# its own tap. Turn 1: Mox Jet's {B} pays the {1} and the pool shows exactly one mana, the chosen {G}, not the {B} and not two; colorless
# is not a color and is refused. With the Prism now tapped, a second activation is refused though Mox Ruby's {R} could pay it. Turn 3:
# it untaps and makes {W} (any color, not just green) for Mox Jet's {B}, the pool showing only the {W}.

